  <div class="main-content-container" style="z-index:5;position:relative;"><div class="fixed-width-container" style="margin-left:auto;padding-left:0.5in;width:7.5in;box-sizing:content-box;margin-right:auto;padding-right:0.5in;"><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:0.33958333333333335in;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Times New Roman;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:0.3402777777777778in;text-align:justify;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:4.7521786492374725%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#x2022;</font><div style="display:inline;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#x201c;contracted capacity&#x201d; means the IT megawatt capacity at each of our wholly-owned, colocation and leased facilities that are under development pursuant to signed contracts with customers.</font></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:0.33958333333333335in;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Times New Roman;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:0.3402777777777778in;text-align:justify;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:4.7521786492374725%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#x2022;</font><div style="display:inline;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#x201c;contracted data center sites&#x201d; means all wholly-owned, colocation and leased facilities that are under development pursuant to signed contracts with customers.</font></div></div><div class="item-list-element