idth:0.3402777777777778in;text-align:justify;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:4.7521786492374725%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#x2022;</font><div style="display:inline;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">our ability to successfully and continuously expand our business domestically and internationally; </font></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:0.33958333333333335in;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Times New Roman;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:0.3402777777777778in;text-align:justify;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:4.7521786492374725%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#x2022;</font><div style="display:inline;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">our ability to secure necessary financing on terms acceptable to us; </font></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:0.33958333333333335in;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Times New Roman;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:0.3402777777777778in;text-align:justify;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:4.7521786492374725%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#x2022;</font><div style="display:inline;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">deferral of orders from customers in anticipation of new or enhanced products and solutions announced by us or our competitors; </font></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:0.33958333333333335in;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Times New Roman;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:0.3402777777777778in;text-align:justify;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:4.7521786492374725%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#x2022;</font><div style="display:inline;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">significant security breaches or, technical difficulties with, or interruptions to the use of our platform, including data security; </font></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:0.33958333333333335in;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Times New Roman;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:0.3402777777777778in;text-align:justify;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:4.7521786492374725%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#x2022;</font><div style="display:inline;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">the timing and costs related to the development or acquisition of technologies or businesses or entry into strategic partnerships; </font></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:0.33958333333333335in;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Times New Roman;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:0.34027777